-- src:3496 | SCHEDULE V (Subsection 12(2.3))
-- src:3497 | Table of Weeks of Benefits — Seasonal Workers
@ref Employment Insurance Act Schedule V (src:3496-3497)
GIVEN hours IS A NUMBER
      rate IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `Act Schedule V the maximum number of weeks of benefits for seasonal workers` IS
    CONSIDER `Act Schedule V the row for the hours of insurable employment` hours
    WHEN NOTHING   THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST row  THEN `ei6 the cell of the row in the column of` row (`the band of the regional rate of unemployment` rate)

